    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Escape to the exquisite charm of our short-term letting property nestled in the serene landscapes of Killiney, Dublin. Experience the epitome of luxury living amidst stunning sea views and meticulously manicured gardens. \r\nWelcome to your dream getaway.\r\n \r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n \r\nIndoor Swimming Pool,Gym and Sauna: Dive into relaxation or maintain your fitness regime in our state-of-the-art indoor swimming pool and gym facilities which include large Sauna.\r\nEntertainment Galore: Entertain guests with ease in our expansive games room, complete with a snooker table, table tennis, fussball, and a fully stocked bar imported from Paris. Submerse yourself in a real cinema with 20ft screen and Wilson audio speakers which includes a professional DJ box and dance floor for unforgettable nights in.\r\n\r\nAudiophiles have a choice of state of the art hi-fi systems to savour in different rooms including the Wilson audio system in the cinema room and the Bowers and Wilkins Nautilus speakers in the main Reception Room and for those Vinyl lovers there is one of Clear Audio’s signature players to enjoy.\r\n\r\nEnchanting Gardens: Lose yourself in the beauty of our 2-acre manicured gardens, boasting a stunning Japanese garden adorned with an array of plants, trees, and shrubs. Every corner offers tranquillity and inspiration.\r\n \r\nOrangery Retreat: Relax in our orangery, a sanctuary of natural light and lush greenery, perfect for unwinding with a book or enjoying a morning coffee by the large original gothic fireplace rescued from Brittany..\r\n \r\nGothic Charm: Immerse yourself in the enchanting atmosphere of our period property, enhanced with a hint of gothic architecture throughout.\r\n \r\nPrivacy and Security: Enjoy peace of mind with our high-tech security system and private parking facilities, ensuring your stay is both safe and secluded.\r\n \r\nLocation: Situated in the prestigious area of Killiney, our property offers easy access to Dublin\\'s vibrant city centre while providing a serene retreat from the hustle and bustle.\r\n \r\nRental Details:\r\n \r\n-              Location: Killiney, Dublin\r\n-              Weekly Rent: €15,000\r\n-              Property Size: Approximately 1500m²\r\n \r\nIndulge in the ultimate luxury experience at our Killiney retreat. Whether you seek relaxation, entertainment, or simply a slice of paradise, our property promises an unforgettable stay. Book your escape today and discover the magic of Dublin\\'s coastline."
      },
